      "name": "DirichletPrefix",
      "signature": "DirichletPrefix(F,G,n,l,M)",
      "summary": "An actual signed table M records the independently defined convolution entry at every inclusive index 0<=d<=l. The endpoint l is included and can differ from n; no sum or convolution identity is assumed."
    },
