      "name": "DirichletSum",
      "signature": "DirichletSum(F,G,n,z)",
      "summary": "Require n>0, construct a real convolution-summand prefix through n, and take its actual signed fold over exactly S n entries. Zero is outside this sum's input domain; no value is assigned by a unit or inversion formula."
    },
